{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-01",
  "title": "犬猿の仲",
  "storyCode": "5-1",
  "avgTag": "戦闘前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7703bb5d2fc5097fa66b21e5c3297d7b44f4185783b7db798f793fa088d38818",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——これからは友達だよ。あの大人たちだって、もう私たちのことはいじめられないんだから！——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——怖がらないで、今日からは何があっても、私が必ず助けてあげるから。——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——私が嫌な目に遭ってたら、あなたも私を絶対に助けてね！　それが友達ってものでしょ！——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——へへ、私たちはこれからもずーっと一緒、そうだよね！——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——あの老公爵が彼女をさらった時、お前が何をしたか、覚えているか？——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——お前は龍門のためにできることなら、本当にどんなことだってしてみせるのだろう？——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——ウェイ……そしてお前は、いま誰を……何を犠牲にしようというのだ？——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "うーん……くっ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "ほら！　起きなさい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "彼女を助け……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "チェン！　起きなさい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……私が行く！　私に行かせてくれ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "*龍門スラング*いつまで寝てんのよ！　手間かけさせるんじゃないわよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "バシャッ——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "うっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ゴホッ、ゴホゴホ……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "起きた？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ゴホッ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "まさか……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ホシグマ、早く来い！　レユニオンが——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "まだ寝ぼけてるの？　負け犬みたいな顔して。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "どうしてお前がいる？　私の部隊はどうした？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "もし全滅したって言ったら？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "痛い目にあいたいのなら、お前もレユニオンの後ろに並んでおけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "脅し文句だけは達者なのね。戦場でそんな勇猛な姿を見た記憶がないのはどうしてかしら？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "何があったんですか？　少し席を外しただけなのに、またいつもの喧嘩ですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "ミス・スワイヤー、隊長に悪態をついたところで、何もいいことはありませんよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スワイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "フンッ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "チェン隊長もです、起きたばかりで何を……。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "…いや、それよりどうして全身ずぶ濡れなんですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "あいつに聞いてみろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "この空のコップがその理由ですか…“お嬢様”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スワイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "くだらない寝言を言ってるからよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "本当にいい加減に…。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ところで、ここはどこだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "ロドスの船室です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スワイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "およそ45分前、アンタは自分の部隊をつれてここに逃げ帰ってきたのよ。覚えてないの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スワイヤー",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "アンタはうまく隠密行動ができてると思ってたみたいだけど、龍門周辺のレユニオンにはバレバレだったみたいよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
